{"id":"n63134-1-7","stage":4,"title":"서먹하다 · 生分","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63134-1-7-1","ko":"너 왜 요즘 민준이랑 서먹하게 지내니?","zh":"你最近为什么和敏俊相处得这么生疏啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"서먹하게","meaning":"生分，陌生，拘谨","explanation":"서먹하다：生分，陌生，拘谨；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"서먹하다","audio":"/audio/c43622f1542054a85c25.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63134","senseId":"1","lemma":"서먹하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내니?","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/